Package: zupmxode
Title: Population Pharmacokinetic and Pharmacodynamic Simulation
    Without a Compiler
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Simulates population pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic
    models written in a subset of the 'rxode2' model language over
    'NONMEM'-style event records, with no C compiler on the machine.
    Models are parsed in R and compiled to native code through 'MIR', or
    run by its interpreter where native code cannot be made. Closed-form
    compartment models are solved exactly, linear systems by a matrix
    exponential, and the rest by 'LSODA' or Dormand-Prince; subjects are
    solved in parallel with 'OpenMP'.
